<article id="post-10927" class="post-10927 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-community">
  <div class="entry-featured">
    <div class="entry-thumb"><img width="851" height="315" src="https://cityofharrah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/HEADER-LANDSCAPED.png" class="attachment-entry-fullwidth size-entry-fullwidth wp-post-image" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" srcset="https://cityofharrah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/HEADER-LANDSCAPED.png 851w, https://cityofharrah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/HEADER-LANDSCAPED-300x111.png 300w, https://cityofharrah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/HEADER-LANDSCAPED-768x284.png 768w, https://cityofharrah.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/HEADER-LANDSCAPED-100x37.png 100w" sizes="(max-width: 851px) 100vw, 851px" /></div>  </div>
  <div class="entry-wrap">
    
<header class="entry-header">
    <h1 class="entry-title">Regarding upcoming election</h1>
    <p class="p-meta"><span><i class='x-framework-icon x-icon-pencil' data-x-icon-s='&#xf303;' aria-hidden=true></i> City Planner</span><span><time class="entry-date" datetime="2026-10-23T14:10:20+00:00"><i class='x-framework-icon x-icon-calendar' data-x-icon-s='&#xf073;' aria-hidden=true></i> October 23, 2026</time></span><span><a href="https://cityofharrah.com/category/community/" title="View all posts in: &ldquo;Community\&rdquo;"><i class='x-framework-icon x-icon-bookmark' data-x-icon-s='&#xf02e;' aria-hidden=true></i>Community</a></span></p></header>    


<div class="entry-content content">


  
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">On Tuesday November 3rd, the City of Harrah will have a measure on the ballot. Currently the elections for the City Council are held on back to back years. This measure will change the spacing of the elections to every two years while still maintaining four year terms. The elections held in 2029 for Mayor, Ward 1, and Ward 3 will be for a 3 year term. This shortened term will not count against the term limit of 2 consecutive terms.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
  

</div>

  </div>
  
</article>        
      
    </div>

          
    
  </div>



  

  <footer class="x-colophon top">
    <div class="x-container max width">

